"Replaces Volla OS with a system from an image file. It then starts without a "
"memory card, from storage that is much faster. All data of Volla OS is "
"erased. Nobody has tried this on a real phone yet."
msgstr ""
"Sostituisce Volla OS con un sistema da un file immagine. Si avvia poi senza "
